	(text "3 in parallel = 0.288667R (E96): lowest limit 3.04 A delivers 112.8 W (>= the 112.2 W 1 s peak) at every input; highest 4.07 A with the line feed-forward (4.46 A without)\nline feed-forward HV_BULK -> CS (CRHV2512): CS offset 101 mV at 1000 V cancels most of the 155-250 ns CS-delay overshoot, so the highest current limit no longer rises with the input\nClamp: BYG10Y + 6 x SMCJ33A; V_DS 1318 / 1422 V at 1000 / 1100 V."
